   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Medborgare f&#xf6;r Europe 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka och formalisera l&#xe5;ngsiktiga plattform f&#xf6;r etablerade   medborgerliga akt&#xf6;rer fr&#xe5;n hela Bosnien och Hercegovina, som          representerar fokus organiserade grupper, att f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka en offentlig och politisk fokusering p&#xe5; s&#xe4;rskilda EU-integrationsfr&#xe5;gor, s&#xf6;ker     konkreta resultat fr&#xe5;n Medborgare f&#xf6;r Europa rekommendationer som     redovisats av politiker, myndigheter och allm&#xe4;nheten sedan 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen and formalize the longer term platform for established  civic actors from across BiH, representing focus organized groups, to advocate a public and political focus on specific EU integration      issues, seeking concrete results from the Citizens for Europe         recommendations that were recognized by politicians, authorities and  the public since 2010</narrative>
  </description>
